+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                     |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: ncat.ns.metrics.id ASC NULLS LAST                                                                  |
|               |   Projection: ncat.ns.metrics.id                                                                         |
|               |     Filter: ncat.ns.metrics.label IS NULL                                                                |
|               |       TableScan: ncat.ns.metrics projection=[id, label], partial_filters=[ncat.ns.metrics.label IS NULL] |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [id@0 ASC NULLS LAST]                                                           |
|               |   SortExec: expr=[id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                     |
|               |     FilterExec: label@1 IS NULL, projection=[id@0]                                                       |
|               |       RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                               |
|               |         CooperativeExec                                                                                  |
|               |           BytesProcessedExec                                                                             |
|               |             FlightSqlExec sql=SELECT id, label FROM ncat.ns.metrics WHERE (("label" IS NULL))            |
|               |                                                                                                          |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
